---
code: cli-no-book-given
when-fires: an analysis invocation named no book, by positional or by flag. cli/lib.rs parse_args_from. No params.
why: there is nothing to analyze and no safe default: guessing a book would be a plan the admin never asked for. dorc why --last is the one exemption, since it reconstructs its book from the durable.
owns: cli-usage-synopsis
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan
dorc: error[cli-no-book-given]: Dorc was given no book to work on; name one as a
positional path or with `--book=PATH`.
usage: dorc [probe|plan|apply] --book=<book.sh> [-o <oracle.sh>]... [--debug-argv]
